# Diagnostics & Crash Handling

## CrashLog

- `CrashLog.InstallGlobalHandlers()` in `Program.cs` before any work.
- Writes to `logs/poe2radar-crash.log` next to exe.
- Log startup context (`BaseDirectory`, attach result) for support debugging.

## Startup failures

Use `Fail(code, message)` — clear, actionable text:

1. PoE2 not running → start game first.
2. GameState slot not found → in zone, try admin.
3. Wait for Enter before exit on fatal errors (console UX).

## Runtime errors

- World/main loops: catch per-iteration, log message, continue.
- API: JSON error response, no process crash.
- Overlay render: try/catch around draw passes; one bad entity must not kill overlay.

## Perf HUD

- `ShowPerfStats` / `ShowFpsOverlay` — opt-in; drives `ProcessMetricsSampler` (see performance rule).
- Segment timings: tick, world, render subdivisions (`mapMs`, `pathsMs`, etc.).

## Console output

- User-facing toggles log to console (`Auto-flask: ON/OFF`). Keep concise; no spam per frame.
